      "problem": "$(-3)\\cdot (-1.2)=$",
      "worked_solution": "We have the product of two negative numbers, which gives a positive number.\n\n$$\n(-3)\\cdot (-1.2)=3\\cdot 1.2=3.6.\n$$",
